  "invariants": [
    "Only READY and READY_WITH_LIMITATIONS with evaluationStatus COMPLETED can pass the final pre-start revalidation.",
    "READY_WITH_LIMITATIONS requires enforceable limitations in the WorkerRun envelope and grants.",
    "Any mandatory HIGH or CRITICAL failure blocks the run.",
    "Policy/ACL uncertainty or evaluator error fails closed.",
    "A readiness evaluation is immutable; a changed snapshot requires a new evaluation.",
    "Every started WorkerRun references the exact readiness evaluation used at dispatch.",
    "Each WorkerRun belongs to exactly one Task and one owning Operation; in MVP WorkerRun.operation_id equals Task.operation_id.",
    "One Operation may contain many Tasks and WorkerRuns; fan-out does not automatically create child Operations.",
    "Child Operations are independent commands and do not inherit ACL automatically.",
    "WorkerRun terminal states are immutable; new substantive attempts create derived WorkerRuns.",
    "Temporal Activity retry/replay does not create a new domain WorkerRun.",
    "WorkerRun COMPLETED is not QA PASS, human Approval, Artifact approval/publication, or Baseline.",
    "Operation aggregation is criteria-based and cannot infer success from counts alone.",
    "CANCEL_REQUESTED is non-terminal; terminal cancellation requires side-effect reconciliation.",
    "BLOCKED is a WorkerRun state; STALE is a ReadinessEvaluation outcome; evaluator error fails closed."
  ],
